      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.99 (up from ₹0.56 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹975.3m (up 107% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹539.1m (up ₹640.2m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 55% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was primarily driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 82% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 8% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
