      "title": "PNB Gilts Ltd. Announces Senior Management and Committee Changes, Effective January 17, 2026",
      "body": "PNB Gilts Limited appointed Ms. Priyanka Gupta, who is presently Chief Manager - PNB, parent bank, as ‘Chief Technical Officer’ designated as Senior Management Personnel of the Company for a tenure of three years, effective from January 17, 2026. She is a B. Tech (Computer Science) from Kurukshetra University, and is a Certified Associate of the Indian Institute of Bankers. She has 18 years of experience in the field of Information Technology. PNB Gilts Limited appointed Ms. Priyanka, who is presently Chief Manager - PNB, parent bank, as ‘Chief Risk Officer’ designated as Senior Management Personnel of the Company for a tenure of three years, effective from January 17, 2026. She is M. Tech. in Mathematics from Delhi University and holds MBA from ICFAI Bangalore and FRM (GARP). She has been",
